 "remarks": "Location, space and convenience come together at 45 Maple Street, Unit 4A. This spacious 1-bedroom condo offers 720 square feet of comfortable living with a bright living and dining area, generous bedroom, full bath, and kitchen with gas cooking, dishwasher, microwave and refrigerator. Situated directly across from Norwalk Hospital and close to shopping, dining and public transportation, this is an ideal option for anyone looking for easy access to everything Norwalk has to offer. Additional conveniences include basement laundry, two unassigned parking spaces, and dedicated storage unit #66 located in the building across the parking lot. Available immediately.",
